* Release v3.7.9
    * (Docker) Fix user-defined interface-specific sysctls on Docker Engine >= v27.0.0
    * Open device terminals when "--privileged" flag is set
    * Assign device FQDN in "/etc/hosts" (if no "/etc/hosts" is passed by the user)
    * Fix TMUX issues